<h1>Transforming events in flight</h1>
<p>As <a href="/concepts-events">events</a> flow from a source <a href="/concepts-connectors">connector</a> to a destination connector, you can modify them in real time. This guide covers how to reshape payloads, filter out unwanted records, and enrich events with additional context inside a <a href="/concepts-pipelines">pipeline</a>.</p>

